OL,3,AWife of man who died after turbulence
OL,4,Asues airline
OL,5,
OL,6,FA widow whose husband died after
OL,7,F"severe turbulence" on a flight has
OL,8,Fbegun legal action against the airline.
OL,10,FLawyers for Linda Kitchen, 74, from
OL,11,FThornbury near Bristol, who broke her
OL,12,Fback during the incident, said her
OL,13,Fhusband, Geoff, 73, was "fatally
OL,14,Finjured" when the Singapore Airlines
OL,15,Fflight from London Heathrow suddenly
OL,16,Fdropped around 6,000 ft (1,828 metres).
OL,18,FShe has now begun proceedings at the
OL,19,FHigh Court seeking damages from the
OL,20,Fairline to help her access specialist
OL,21,Fsupport for her back. The BBC has
OL,22,Fcontacted the airline for comment.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,116,105,200,300,0,100
