OL,3,AWife of man who died after turbulence
OL,4,Asues airline
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I got separated from Geoff, I
OL,7,Fknew he was in a bad way, but nothing
OL,8,Fprepared me for hearing he had died. It
OL,9,Fwas absolutely devastating," she said.
